    "reasoner_response": "Tell the customer: "I'd recommend starting with your selling dealer, Texas Auto Group, who can be reached at 2145550100. They're familiar with your contract and can work directly with Assurant on your behalf. Your contract may require you to return to your selling dealer. To confirm, you can view your contract and acceptable repair locations at vehicle care plan dot com. The repair facility (not you) must contact Assurant to initiate and authorize the claim process before repairs begin. To get started: 1. Take your vehicle to a repair facility (selling dealer preferred, or any repair location found on vehicle care plan dot com). 2. The repair facility contacts Assurant to get the claim authorized. 3. Assurant reviews and authorizes covered repairs. If you need help locating a repair facility, you can find one online at vehicle care plan dot com. If you want to speak to an agent for help with this, let me know what specific help you need so I can make sure you reach the right person."",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
